## What Was Built

### Directory Structure

```
mysql/
├── build/              # CMake (git-ignored)
├── source/             # MySQL 9.6.0 source (git-ignored)
├── installed-files/    # Compiled binaries (git-ignored)
│   ├── bin/mysqld      # Server daemon
│   ├── bin/mysql       # Client
│   └── lib/            # Libraries
├── databases/          # TRACKED - custom world data
│   ├── acore_auth/
│   ├── acore_world/
│   ├── acore_characters/
│   ├── acore_playerbots/
│   └── mysql.sock      # Unix socket (git-ignored)
└── conf/
    └── my.cnf          # TRACKED - server config
```

### Scripts Created

1. **scripts/mysql-install** - Compile MySQL 9.6.0 from source
2. **scripts/start-mysql** - Start daemon, track PID
3. **scripts/stop-mysql** - Graceful shutdown
4. **scripts/mysql-client** - Connect using project credentials

### Configuration

Port 3307 (different from system MySQL 3306):
```ini
[mysqld]
basedir = mysql/installed-files
datadir = mysql/databases
socket  = mysql/databases/mysql.sock
port    = 3307

[client]
socket  = mysql/databases/mysql.sock
port    = 3307
```

