## MySQL 9.x Migration

### Breaking Change

MySQL 9.x deprecated `innodb_log_file_size` in favor of `innodb_redo_log_capacity`.

**Old (MySQL 8.x):**
```ini
innodb_log_file_size = 512M
```

**New (MySQL 9.x):**
```ini
innodb_redo_log_capacity = 512M
```

This was discovered when initialization failed with deprecation warnings. Updated my.cnf accordingly.

### User Creation

Created user matching `secrets.conf`:
```sql
CREATE USER 'ritz'@'localhost' IDENTIFIED BY '***';
CREATE USER 'ritz'@'127.0.0.1' IDENTIFIED BY '***';
GRANT ALL ON acore_*.* TO 'ritz'@'localhost';
GRANT ALL ON acore_*.* TO 'ritz'@'127.0.0.1';
```

Both localhost and 127.0.0.1 needed for socket vs TCP connections.

