## Usage

```bash
# Start MySQL (required before worldserver)
./scripts/start-mysql

# Connect to database
./scripts/mysql-client

# Run queries
mysql> USE acore_world;
mysql> SELECT * FROM creature LIMIT 10;

# Stop MySQL
./scripts/stop-mysql
```

### First-Time Setup

After cloning the repo:
1. MySQL binaries might not be built → run `./scripts/mysql-install`
2. Database files should exist (tracked in git)
3. Run `./scripts/start-mysql` → should just work

